WEBVTT

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:15.590
M4A1 succeeded in meeting up with
SOPII under the command of Gentiane,

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.930
a new Griffin Commander.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:17.800
"A member of Griffin's AR Team"

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:17.800
a new Griffin Commander.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.810
"A member of Griffin's AR Team"

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.810
But AR15 was nowhere to be found.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.980
And you need our help.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.440
Am I right?

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.950
An elite doll like you might not be
satisfied with fighting this way, but...

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.700
Oh, no...

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.080
I don't want them to die.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.040
SOP II, what about AR15?

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:43.580
AR15 acted as a decoy so I could escape.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.710
"A member of Griffin's AR Team"

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.710
AR15 acted as a decoy so I could escape.

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:47.580
AR15 acted as a decoy so I could escape.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.250
Hunter is clever.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.340
We need to hurry or
AR15 will be in danger!

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:56.760
Let's go save AR15!

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:59.100
I can't allow another mission.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:03.100
A real hunter silently waits for her prey.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.980
The information we have

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:15.030
leads us to believe that Sangvis is
manufacturing their reinforcements here.

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:16.530
Understood.

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:19.320
Command will be eager to hear this.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:29.130
But M4 said all of you would help us.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.170
Commander Gentiane...

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:34.800
If there's nothing else,
I'd like to end the call.

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.180
Is something wrong?

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:44.220
Actually, there's something
I'm concerned about.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.230
Excuse me.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.820
What happened?

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.190
It's a long story.

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:56.110
I'll make this fast, then.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.450
A new mission is about to begin.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:01.370
The commander says that
if you want to save AR15,

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:05.200
come to the briefing
room within 15 minutes.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.120
I'm going! I'm going!

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.870
Why?

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.210
She said there'd be no other missions.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:16.460
Sometimes what humans say
and what they do are different.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.010
Unlike us dolls.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.450
Hey there.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.790
We met on that mission.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.790
You're M4A1, right? I'm PPSh-41!

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:16.420
I've wanted to thank you!

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.670
I'm glad you're safe.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:22.010
It was a little close, though.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:26.300
If the commander's team had
arrived any later, I think...

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.600
I'm sorry.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.770
My orders weren't the right ones.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:37.440
You were the ones who were
manipulating the two of them.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:38.940
We...

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.190
FNC!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:46.360
If it weren't for M4, the Sangvis
would've slaughtered us,

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:50.700
and we would've had to be restored
from backups and given new bodies.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.710
They saved me, too.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:58.710
I was only able to escape because
they pulled away the Agents.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:00.250
Fine.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:04.340
And what kind of commander
leaves their dolls behind?

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.800
Don't worry about her.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.140
We're all grateful to you!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:13.430
Okay!

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:16.690
It's time for the briefing.

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.650
Move to the secondary level.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.490
We've identified the ringleader of S09.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.700
It's SP-721, Hunter.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.290
A dangerous Sangvis High-End Model.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.790
This is the area under control.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:43.670
She has a large base, and is likely
in possession of a strong force.

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:49.390
Our mission is to recon her base
and transfer the data we find to HQ.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.350
This is the infiltration route.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:57.440
Other Griffin units will be providing
support for this mission.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.350
Meet up with them when you arrive.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.400
Yes!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:06.610
Check the list of participants and
get the equipment you need.

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:07.820
Dismissed!

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:13.160
Wait for me, AR15.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:31.640
What're we looking at?

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:33.470
Increasing amounts of Sangvis signals.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.470
Prepare for combat, everyone.

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.600
This is a recon mission.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.060
Don't forget that, everyone.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.860
The first unit has arrived
at their destination point.

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.400
Launching drone.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.970
What is this?

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.970
There's so many!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:16.010
This is how Sangvis works.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:20.140
One ringleader can easily
create a huge army.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.640
Correct.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:25.150
There's a limit to how many
dummies you can create.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:28.530
Sangvis dolls are inferior to
you on a one-to-one basis,

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.530
but they make up for it with numbers.

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:35.280
G36, move the drone to area 3B!

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.490
Roger.

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.580
An underground transport line?

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:49.420
No point in trying to surround
them and wait them out.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:53.130
The Sangvis AI has a
pretty high privilege level.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:54.180
Kalina...

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:55.220
Yes?

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:59.060
Get me the status of all our dolls and a
list of how much material we've got.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.180
This is might be a big one.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.140
Roger.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.060
Huh?

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.190
What's wrong?

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:08.530
M4's data is a little odd.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:11.360
I wonder if the maintenance
wasn't fully completed?

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:15.950
If it won't interfere with
the mission, just leave it.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:17.910
Let's focus on our work first.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.330
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:22.080
When you add up the ones on the
inside and the outside of the base,

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.580
there's probably a ton of Sangvis here!

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:30.340
G36, scan the base's
internals with a drone.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:31.840
Then stand by.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.050
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.550
Commander...

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:38.300
M4, have you forgotten the
purpose of this mission?

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.350
No.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.350
We're the recon team.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:43.810
We just need to gather information.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:49.900
If we're just recon, then why
do we need this equipment?

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:54.200
You really came, M4A1?

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:57.820
Somebody's on the open channel!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.080
This voice...!

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.410
Hunter!

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:06.210
The kid's there, too?

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:08.420
So this is the ringleader?

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:13.210
Did you think I wouldn't catch you
trespassing in my territory?

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:17.470
As you know, AR15 is in our hands.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.220
I'll let you hear her voice.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:25.890
Stay away, M4!

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.980
It's all my--

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.030
How moving!

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:38.410
But you know what to do now
that you've heard that, right?

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.620
Surrender, M4A1,

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:43.910
and I'll return AR15.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:45.790
Shut your mouth!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.130
Make your decision fast.

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:53.250
There's any number of ways for
me to deal with Griffin's forces.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.550
You'll never take this base.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:03.970
Damn it! "Surrender", she says?

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:06.430
G36, what did the scan show?

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:10.730
It's faint, but I found AR15's signal.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.070
Commander!

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.480
I know what you're thinking.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.650
But look at the enemy base!

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:19.740
Anything reckless you do will
put your comrades in danger!

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.960
Now, what do you think they'll do?

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:38.170
Did I hurt you a little too much?

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:41.180
You don't look that weak.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.680
Kill me.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.520
Don't be in such a hurry.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.230
Keep struggling!

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:54.320
Do you think M4A1 will come save you?

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:58.990
A human commander has the right
to give her orders right now.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.240
She can't make that decision on her own.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:06.700
But AR Team can make
their own decisions, right?

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:10.460
The mission or you...
Which will M4A1 chose?

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:11.920
I can't wait to see.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:19.670
"A real hunter silently waits
for her prey," you said.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.680
But you sure talk a lot.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.850
Silence!

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.140
M4?

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:27.890
You're right.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:30.940
We can't abandon our comrades.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:34.400
AR15 would make the same call in my place.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:38.400
SOPII?

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:41.240
You're the leader of AR Team!

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.820
You'll lead us to victory.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:45.200
Right?

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.160
I...

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:53.580
What?

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:22.700
What happened?

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:25.280
Smoke's rising from the Sangvis base.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.280
Some kind of explosion, evidently.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:30.580
What's going on?

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.960
G36, send the drone into the base.

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.170
Roger.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.090
Damn it!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.840
Why'd it derail?

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.590
Activate the fire suppression system!
Get out of the area!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.150
What's going on here?

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.770
They're shooting each other?

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.440
What happened?

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.160
Helian, can you see this?

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:08.030
The Sangvis dolls have
started shooting each other.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:11.240
We don't know why, but this is our chance.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.660
We should attack now.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.710
Yes.

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.880
If we take this base,
future missions will become easier.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.920
Your new mission is to
annihilate the Sangvis.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.260
You are now authorized
to command the mission.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:27.140
Work with the other units
to annihilate the enemy.

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:30.560
Destroy the Sangvis, Commander Gentiane.

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:31.770
Roger.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:36.520
This is Commander Shi Jun of Base 601.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.940
This is Kamolov of Base 737.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:41.440
I'm Gentiane.

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:43.740
I'm in charge of this operation.

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:46.910
I'd like your units to join us for this.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.160
Roger.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.330
Updating IFF signals.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.450
I'll share the current
battle situation with you.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.160
Update complete.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:57.710
Where do we start?

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:00.000
This is a Sangvis transport hub.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.210
There are large amounts of
enemies and supplies here.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:05.470
The area is surrounded by
walls with gun turrets on them.

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:07.970
There's even a platform for the trains.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:09.470
But minutes ago,

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:13.810
the Sangvis dolls started attacking
each other for an unknown reason.

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:15.640
They can't use their platform either,

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.640
so they won't be able
to resupply for a while.

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:20.690
This is our only chance
to take down the base.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:22.570
Makes sense.

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:25.990
I agree with Commander Gentiane's opinion.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:28.700
But we don't have enough firepower.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.780
Even if our enemies are
fighting each other,

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:33.330
breaking through those
defenses will be difficult.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.910
I'll explain my plan.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:38.420
Why?

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.460
Why are they attacking each other?

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:44.250
The chain of command's been altered?

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.800
Impossible!

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:54.100
There's nothing for me to do!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:57.640
SOPII, we're the infiltration squad.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.270
Right!

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:05.230
M4, there's a large data flow
15 meters directly below you.

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:06.320
Roger.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.820
I'll look for the entrance.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.910
Clear!

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.450
Is this... an abandoned area?

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:22.670
M4, there's an access board!

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:24.250
I'll jack in.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.260
Protect me.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.470
Okay.

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:44.940
Passive firewalls...

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.110
When you can visualize them,

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:48.820
Sangvis's systems are
actually pretty simple.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:56.200
The enemy's here, huh?

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:01.500
It'll take more offensive barriers
than that to stop me.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:06.340
I want to go outside and smash things.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:09.590
Why did they start shooting each other?

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:12.880
Welcome back.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.260
Can we shut down the system?

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:17.640
It'll be easy.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:21.520
This defense system is
more or less useless.

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.150
Our elite dolls are inside the base.

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:26.360
I had them shut down the defense system.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.980
Nicely done.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:32.070
Now it's our turn!

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:33.450
I've been waiting for this.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.910
Sniper teams, sitrep.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.990
Sniper teams in position.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.790
Fine. I'll do it for you.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:42.830
Your targets are the
Sangvis dolls on the front wall.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.040
Fire!

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.250
M4, open the main gate!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:48.460
Roger!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.760
Commander Kamolov!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:52.880
Roger!

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:55.180
Let's go, ladies!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.510
Attention all dolls.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.930
I've shared the blind spots of
the remaining cannons with you.

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:00.770
Use them to plot your route.

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:02.520
Thank you. That's a huge help.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:07.060
Unit 1, Unit 2, after them!

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:07.980
Roger!

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.900
G36, once you have the area
around the front gate clear,

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.320
place drones and secure a supply line!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:14.610
Roger.

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:17.570
Kalina, prepare a resupply helicopter.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.240
Right, already on it!

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:22.620
The defense system's down.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:25.540
Damn you, Griffin!

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.960
Dummies! Advance!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:39.050
Target sighted.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.850
Begin the hunt.

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:46.140
I lost a dummy!

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.020
What? I thought they were
attacking each other!

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:50.190
You!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:56.280
You should've just stayed home.

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:57.530
The Sangvis Ringleader!

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:58.740
I'll get her!

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:01.450
She's fast!

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.250
Updating orders.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:09.670
Destroy all Griffin dolls within the base!

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:16.510
Oh, no! The ringleader
rewrote their orders!

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:18.800
Take the ringleader down first!

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:19.680
I can't!

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.300
I can't aim fast enough!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.640
Keep shooting!

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:24.180
Slow her down!

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:26.180
Unit 1, break through the encirclement.

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:28.980
Link up with M4 and support
the attack on the ringleader!

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:30.110
Roger!

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:32.360
Bring down that ringleader!

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:35.280
M4, can't we go save her?

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.240
No.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:40.240
If this position falls,
the Sangvis will get us all.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:42.740
Believe in our comrades!

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.710
It's your turn to die next!

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:53.290
Too slow!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.510
Is that even possible?

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.480
The Sangvis offensive is
growing more intense.

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:16.530
Can we really break through this?

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.740
Focus on the mission for now.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.910
Commander, the Sangvis
have blocked the main gate!

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:28.160
We can't advance!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.790
Your orders!

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:31.960
Withdraw?

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:37.090
Even if you do make it through,

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:40.510
it's only a matter of time
before you're turned to scrap.

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:44.050
There are so many places
to ambush someone here!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.010
Yes, there sure are.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:59.440
How does it feel to be the hunted, Hunter?

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.360
You!

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:03.780
I broke your legs.

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:07.160
Your speed is a threat,
even if the rest of you isn't.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.660
I don't understand. How?

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.290
Your next target would be M4.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.830
Predicting the route you'd take was easy.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:19.670
So I shut off comms,
placed the bombs, and waited.

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:23.680
There are so many places to
ambush someone here, after all.

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.100
That's not what I asked.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.850
How do you have Sangvis command authority?

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:35.230
I just changed the orders from inside
and caused chaos. Nothing more.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:39.980
I may be special, huh, Hunter?

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:44.320
You're a very cautious girl, and I
didn't want you going underground.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:48.120
You let me capture you deliberately?

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.740
That's what you said.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:53.080
A real hunter chooses silence.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:58.550
And you're about to go silent forever.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:10.470
Enemy dolls have gone silent.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:13.020
The attack has stopped.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.810
Stay on standby until further orders.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.440
I'll contact you soon.

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.230
Roger.

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:21.070
Did M4 defeat the ringleader?

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:23.490
I guess the elites really
are different, huh?

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:26.950
Huh? It's over?

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:33.410
AR15! Hey!

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:35.290
You're late.

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:37.460
I was thinking I'd never get out of here.

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:41.710
What? What kind of greeting is that?

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:44.420
AR15, I'm glad you're okay.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.550
You really came.

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:55.060
M4, if this hadn't happened,
would you have taken my place?

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.440
I don't know.

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:59.980
You're the leader of AR Team.

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:01.860
Don't do anything stupid.

00:22:01.860 --> 00:22:03.440
But I...

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:07.320
M4, we all have our own responsibilities.

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.120
Sometimes we don't get to make choices.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:14.790
And M16 is still waiting
for us to save her.

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:18.670
Yeah. Next time, I'll be more careful.

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:24.960
What's wrong? Look at you, sounding cool.

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:27.180
You shut up.

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:30.260
That hurts! That hurts, AR15!

00:22:30.260 --> 00:22:33.430
Stay silent forever, SOPII!

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:35.390
Help me, Leader!

00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:36.730
M4...

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:49.450
Big Sis M16...

00:24:21.870 --> 00:24:25.540
Commander Gentiane, your next mission.

00:24:25.540 --> 00:24:30.260
There's a team investigating
a file full of Sangvis secrets.

00:24:30.260 --> 00:24:32.260
I want you to help them.

00:24:37.810 --> 00:24:40.230
I'll provide further details later.

00:24:43.100 --> 00:24:46.520
Episode 6: "The Message 01."
